Livery decal slot (optional, user-supplied).

The bundled liveries (data/liveries/<team>.json) are colours only: base, secondary, accent and a number
colour. They carry no logos, sponsor text or badges, on purpose, because those are trademarks.

If you want your own decals, drop PNG files here and list them per team under "liveries" in
web/assets/local_index.json. You are responsible for having the right to use anything you add.
